1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Every search, video, and website visit can contribute to how digital platforms understand us.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Account exports are fragmented, difficult to compare, and difficult to interpret.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Meet SOVRIVA: Your Digital Identity. Your Control.

4
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:35,000
A local-first privacy intelligence platform for individuals, educators, and researchers.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:47,000
The local engine validates supported exports, detects duplicates, and preserves original evidence.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Profile Drift compares real snapshots and separates new, retained, supported-removed, and uncertain records.

7
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Cross-platform comparison avoids weak matches, and every finding has a source trail.

8
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Users can record a privacy action and compare it with a later export.

9
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:32,000
SOVRIVA reports an observed change, no change observed, or not verifiable.

10
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:44,000
The Chrome and Edge extension adds a live protection layer using normalized request metadata.

11
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Advertising blocking and tracker protection remain independent across three protection modes.

12
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:08,000
SOVRIVA is built with FastAPI, SQLite, and Manifest V3.

13
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:18,000
The current classifier is deterministic and explainable by design.

14
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:28,000
The next step is an optional local model evaluated with precision, recall, and macro-F1.

15
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:38,000
SOVRIVA can support individuals, universities, educators, researchers, and institutions.

16
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:48,000
A free local core can grow into advanced reporting without selling personal data.

17
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:55,000
SOVRIVA. Your Digital Identity. Your Control.
